  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/965415649/rust-v0.171.0</id>
    <updated>2026-11-20T00:47:14Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.171.0"/>
    <title>0.171.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Added GPT-6.2 Sol and Astra to model catalogs, with Sol as the default catalog selection. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6453062015&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/62106&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/62106/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/62106&quot;&gt;#62106&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Enabled the TUI workspace by default, with searchable document previews, image previews, and subagent transcripts alongside the main conversation. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6377870893&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61352&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/61352/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61352&quot;&gt;#61352&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6431549440&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61888&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/61888/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61888&quot;&gt;#61888&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6431558130&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61889&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/61889/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61889&quot;&gt;#61889&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6433779014&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61919&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/61919/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61919&quot;&gt;#61919&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6458287384&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/62157&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/62157/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/62157&quot;&gt;#62157&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Added configurable undo and redo shortcuts to the non-Vim prompt composer, including restoration of attachments and large pastes. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6436316121&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61954&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/61954/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61954&quot;&gt;#61954&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;codex exec --remote &amp;lt;ADDR&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; to start or resume noninteractive sessions on an existing app server. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6411299885&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61707&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/61707/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61707&quot;&gt;#61707&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;/rc&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;/remote&lt;/code&gt; to manage local remote control and display device pairing codes from the TUI. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6455711214&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/62121&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/62121/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/62121&quot;&gt;#62121&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Added custom MCP status line selection and authoring through &lt;code&gt;/statusline&lt;/code&gt; when &lt;code&gt;tui_extensions_statusline&lt;/code&gt; is enabled. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6438925698&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61979&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/61979/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61979&quot;&gt;#61979&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6440007841&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61988&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/61988/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61988&quot;&gt;#61988&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6444458946&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/62037&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/62037/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/62037&quot;&gt;#62037&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
