  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/965415649/rust-v0.170.0</id>
    <updated>2026-11-18T03:45:39Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.170.0"/>
    <title>0.170.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Added WebRTC negotiation for realtime voice calls in the TUI. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6357685721&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61172&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/61172/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61172&quot;&gt;#61172&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Added automatically refreshed authentication headers for OpenTelemetry HTTP exporters. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6343445695&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61028&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/61028/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61028&quot;&gt;#61028&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Added experimental support for using identically named MCP servers across environments. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6339210232&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60905&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/60905/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60905&quot;&gt;#60905&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Oversized WebSocket requests now fall back to HTTP without unnecessary retries. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6335253805&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60840&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/60840/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60840&quot;&gt;#60840&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6335263304&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60841&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/60841/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60841&quot;&gt;#60841&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fixed MCP OAuth credential races during cancellation, login, and logout. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6335577102&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60849&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/60849/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60849&quot;&gt;#60849&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6341654512&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60981&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/60981/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60981&quot;&gt;#60981&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Improved automatic reconnection for Cloud conversations and preserved active recovery turns when clients reconnect. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6340940153&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60969&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/60969/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60969&quot;&gt;#60969&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6342706645&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61014&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/61014/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61014&quot;&gt;#61014&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
